Package: envharmonizer
Title: Versioned Environmental Data Harmonization
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Sean", "Thimons", email = "thimons.sean@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Offline access to versioned, reviewable snapshots of the
    Analytical Methods and Open Spectral Database (AMOS), harmonized against
    the Environment Ontology (ENVO) and the Chemical Methods Ontology (CHMO).
    Also provides explicit, release-matched ECOTOX lifestage mappings with
    source evidence and experimental review status. Released tables are
    embedded for deterministic access; the package makes no network requests.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/seanthimons/envharmonizer
BugReports: https://github.com/seanthimons/envharmonizer/issues
